# Copy this file to .env and set DASHBOARD_PASSWORD. Everything else works as
# it stands. The other thing the assistant needs is the session file, see
# "Connecting Facebook" in the README.

# --- Dashboard -----------------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED. The password of the dashboard, at least 8 characters. The dashboard
# shows customers' names, phone numbers and chats.
DASHBOARD_PASSWORD=

# Where the dashboard listens. 127.0.0.1 means: only from this machine. To open
# it from a phone or another computer, put it behind HTTPS (see the README)
# rather than changing the host.
# DASHBOARD_HOST=127.0.0.1
# DASHBOARD_PORT=3400

# The address under which the team reaches the dashboard, put into the
# messages the team gets on Messenger. Leave empty for no link.
# DASHBOARD_URL=https://desk.example.com

# --- Facebook ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The session file: the cookies of a browser that is signed in to Facebook and
# switched into the Page. It is a login to the company's account: keep it on
# this machine only.
# FB_SESSION_FILE=./var/facebook-session.json

# How messages are sent: mqtt (over the live Messenger connection) or http
# (by web request). If "pnpm fb:check --reply" cannot send with one, set the other.
# FB_SEND_VIA=mqtt

# The User-Agent of the browser the session file was exported from (search the
# web for "what is my user agent" in that browser). Optional.
# FB_USER_AGENT=

# --- The team ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Facebook ids of team members who get a Messenger message when a booking
# comes in or a chat needs a person; several ids separated by commas. Each of
# them must have written to the Page once. "pnpm fb:check" shows the id of
# whoever writes to the Page while it runs.
# STAFF_THREAD_IDS=

# --- Behaviour -----------------------------------------------------------------
# How long the assistant waits for a customer to finish writing before it answers.
# REPLY_WAIT_SECONDS=2.5

# How long the assistant stays out of a chat after a person of the team wrote
# in it, or after it passed the chat to a person.
# STAFF_PAUSE_HOURS=12

# After this many answers in one chat within an hour the assistant stops and
# calls a person: it is probably talking to another automatic account.
# MAX_REPLIES_PER_HOUR=40

# --- Files ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# What the assistant says and sells.
# BUSINESS_FILE=config/business.ts

# Where the database (bookings, chats) and the session file are kept. Back this
# folder up.
# DATA_DIR=./var

# debug, info, warn, error or silent
# LOG_LEVEL=info
